    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, especially since my education level is lower secondary. I find it abstract and often struggle to see its practical applications, unlike subjects like chemistry or history where I can relate more easily. However, I appreciate its importance in problem-solving and logic.",
